  "link-href-2": "https://www.innovorder.com/en/success-stories/marmites-innovorder",
  "title-post": "How Marmites easily manages its food court with Innovorder ",
  "current-post-image-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/65256cdbdcd61ea92b3b9df6_Screenshot%202023-10-10%20at%2017.22.31.avif",
  "current-post-image-sizes": "100vw",
  "current-post-image-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/65256cdbdcd61ea92b3b9df6_Screenshot%202023-10-10%20at%2017.22.31-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/65256cdbdcd61ea92b3b9df6_Screenshot%202023-10-10%20at%2017.22.31.avif 1200w",
  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/65256a9c5421cb1725cb3a7c_811605_c80674dcca2d4946b9bc0a3b96abad1a~mv2.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "How Marmites easily manages its food court with Innovorder ",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oQ6bx5tGMEI\" title=\"Marmites: managing the complexity of a food court\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <p>Sébastien co-founded Marmites, a digital food court with two locations: in the heart of Lille and in Marcq-en-Baroeul. To reach as many customers as possible, he offers delivery (online ordering and click &amp; collect) and on-site order-taking. </p>\n          <p>So he turned to Innovorder and its complete ecosystem to manage his entire restaurant on the same solution: order taking, kitchen preparation, checkout, order management and control.</p>\n          <h4>Challenge 1: display all your brands and products</h4>\n          <p>On site, as the food court houses 6 brands, each with its own menu, Sébastien chose the only solution capable of displaying his entire offer: Innovorder order terminals. These are the only kiosks on the market capable of displaying all his brands' menus on a single interface. </p>\n          <h4>2nd challenge: mastering production in the kitchen</h4>\n          <p>In the kitchen, managing multi-brand orders requires ultra-rigorous organization to prepare a maximum number of orders without making mistakes.</p>\n          <p>To meet this challenge, production screens help your team to : <br>- intelligently optimize the preparation process, <br>- eliminate tickets that accumulate in the mess, <br>- and get a clear, instant overview of each order. </p>\n          <blockquote>\"KDS make it possible to remove paperwork, juggle orders, go back, and have everything right in front of you.\"</blockquote>\n          <p>-</p>\n          <p>Are you opening a food court? Call on Innovorder to help you with your project. </p>\n          <p>👉 <a href=\"/en/commercial-catering/food-court\">Discover our expertise in food courts</a></p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Pots",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Food court",
  "div-html": "\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5975dd1a0229_Borne%20de%20commande.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Self Ordering Kiosk</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/online-ordering-for-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59e0dd1a0228_Commande%20en%20ligne.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Online Ordering</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/kitchen-display-system\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc595abf1a0222_%C3%A9cran%20de%20production.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Kitchen Display System</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc596eea1a0225_Portefeuille-2.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Cash register</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                ",
